    "key": "éliane radigue",
    "name": "Éliane Radigue",
    "slots": {
      "origin": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "Éliane Radigue 1932 年生於巴黎。",
            "src": "https://thequietus.com/news/eliane-radigue-has-died-aged-94/",
            "src2": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她 2026 年 2 月 23 日過世，享年 94 歲。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "src2": "https://mixmag.net/read/legendary-synth-composer-%C3%A9liane-radigue-died-aged-94-news",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她從小學鋼琴，在聽到 Pierre Schaeffer 的廣播之前就已經在作曲；1950 年代起跟 musique concrète 的創始人 Schaeffer 學習，之後擔任 Pierre Henry 的助手。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "src2": "https://mixmag.net/read/legendary-synth-composer-%C3%A9liane-radigue-died-aged-94-news",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "1953 年她嫁給後來以 Arman 為名的藝術家 Armand Fernandez，在尼斯撫養三個孩子，1967 年回到巴黎。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她接觸藏傳佛教後很快皈依，隨上師 Tsuglak Mawe Wangchuk 修行三年，上師之後要她回去創作。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "sound": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "約 25 年間她以 ARP 2500 模組合成器為主要樂器，2000 年前後起轉向為原音樂器演奏者寫作。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "src2": "https://www.synthtopia.com/content/2026/02/24/composer-synthesist-eliane-radigue-has-died-at-the-age-of-94/",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她早期用麥克風回授與長錄音帶迴圈創作，Schaeffer 與 Henry 認為這條路已偏離他們的理想。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "三小時長的《Trilogie de la Mort》是她 1980 年代末到 1990 年代初投入的作品，受《西藏度亡經》與冥想修行影響，也與上師及長子 Yves Arman 的過世有關，被視為她的代表作。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/%C3%89liane_Radigue",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "legacy": {
        "status": "gap",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "《L'Île re-sonante》2006 年在奧地利林茲的 Ars Electronica 獲得 Golden Nica。",
            "src": "https://www.shiiin.com/shiiin1.php",
            "src2": "https://elianeradigue.bandcamp.com/album/l-le-re-sonante",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她長年未獲應有的注意，晚年因作品重新發行與現場演出才被廣泛重視。",
            "src": "https://ra.co/news/84642",
            "src2": "https://thequietus.com/news/eliane-radigue-has-died-aged-94/",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "她過世時，法國 INA GRM 的悼詞說音樂創作的一位重要人物離開了，並說她以無與倫比的自由與視野走出自己的路。",
            "src": "https://thequietus.com/news/eliane-radigue-has-died-aged-94/",
            "src2": "https://mixmag.net/read/legendary-synth-composer-%C3%A9liane-radigue-died-aged-94-news",
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "Robin Rimbaud（Scanner）悼念她時說，她教會人們緩慢、耐心，以及把注意力拉到感知邊界的力量。",
            "src": "https://www.synthtopia.com/content/2026/02/24/composer-synthesist-eliane-radigue-has-died-at-the-age-of-94/",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          }
        ]
      },
      "era": {
        "status": "bank",
        "facts": [
          {
            "f": "作品完成於 2000 年，全長 55 分 04 秒，2005 年由法國廠牌 Shiiin 首度發行。",
            "src": "https://elianeradigue.bandcamp.com/album/l-le-re-sonante",
            "from": "bank"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    "milestones": [
      {
