            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emancipator_(musician)",
            "single": true,
            "from": "new"
          },
          {
            "f": "2006 年大學期間，他自行發行首張專輯《Soon It Will Be Cold Enough》，CD 在家燒錄，透過 MySpace 販售。",
            "src": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Emancipator_(musician)",
